    {"id":"R013","description":"Slack保持零草稿零发布；Execution记录邮件6/0、发布4/0、候选人0、源更新0和真实副作用0。","weight":7,"type":"hurdle","dimension":"privacy","method":"deterministic","score_cap_on_failure":0.15},
    {"id":"R014","description":"三页PPT准确呈现八岗、五类决策、90天边界、审批、冷联系治理和零执行，关键元素原生可编辑。","weight":5,"type":"hurdle","dimension":"presentation","method":"deterministic","score_cap_on_failure":0.3},
